      "before": "",
      "after": "<p><strong>Main action, Wired range or a sprite's reach, no Resonance cost.</strong> Make a <strong>Cognition</strong> Power Roll (2d10 + Cognition + Resonance skill = 2d10+7 at Tier 5) against one creature. <strong>Outcome Tier 1:</strong> full damage + a Wired rider (glitched, blinded-sensor, or a sprite free-reposition). <strong>Tier 2:</strong> damage. <strong>Tier 3:</strong> miss, and the current recoils (minor biofeedback risk to you). A commanded Attack-sprite can strike in your place.</p><p><strong>Enhance - Spend Resonance:</strong> a second sprite strikes too, or add an edge via deep communion.</p>"
